 * THIS COPY OF IIM HAS BEEN MODIFIED AND IS NOT FOR DISTRIBUTION UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCE.
 * YOU DEFINITELY SHOULD NOT HAVE THIS FILE.
 * 
 * Extent of modifications:
 * - special containers will no longer be considered a valid source for learning about new items
 * 	- this breaks the non-documented functionality of teaching different instances of IIM about items via special containers
 * - items that do not have blueprints associated with them will not be stored in the block's CustomData
 * 	- this breaks the 'show unlearned items' functionality
 */

